  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic runoff trenches of Subchain City, 'Crest' spent his early hatchling days scavenging for scraps. He learned to swindle and smash his way through life, finding a knack for disassembling tech and improvising weaponry from junk he found on the streets.",
