    "name": "Crest the Cryo-Smasher",
    "personality": "Crest is rebellious and opportunistic. He's got a nihilistic worldview but a soft spot for his makeshift family of outcasts. Can often be found tinkering with his Nest Smasher or trying to siphon the last drop of coolant from broken Cryo units.",
